From: ma3063-openwrt <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath11k: use QSDK 256M ring sizes on low-memory devices

ath11k fills its RX rings with ~2.5 KiB buffers at probe time, per radio,
even while the interfaces are down. On a 256 MiB IPQ5018 + QCN6102 board
(Ruijie RG-MA3063) unloading ath11k frees ~97 MiB.

Use the ring sizes from the vendor (Ruijie/QSDK) firmware for the same
board, taken from /ini/internal/QCA5018_i.ini and QCN6122_i.ini, which
the QSDK scripts set for the 256 MiB profile (update_ini_for_lowmem):

  ring                     ath11k   QSDK 256M   this patch
  rxdma monitor buf          4096        128          128
  rxdma monitor dst          2048        128          128
  rxdma monitor status       1024        512          512
  rxdma monitor desc         4096       4096          512
  tx completion             32768       8192         8192

The RX buffer ring keeps the ath11k default (4096), as does QSDK's refill
ring. The monitor descriptor ring only holds descriptors; IPQ5018 does not
support monitor mode in ath11k, so it stays small.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0111edZhvhVsk8YZUqvNB7tj
---
diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/dp.h b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/dp.h
index 7a55afd..725fecf 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/dp.h
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/dp.h
@@ -206,7 +206,7 @@ struct ath11k_pdev_dp {
 #define DP_WBM_RELEASE_RING_SIZE	64
 #define DP_TCL_DATA_RING_SIZE		512
 #define DP_TCL_DATA_RING_SIZE_WCN6750	2048
-#define DP_TX_COMP_RING_SIZE		32768
+#define DP_TX_COMP_RING_SIZE		8192
 #define DP_TX_IDR_SIZE			DP_TX_COMP_RING_SIZE
 #define DP_TCL_CMD_RING_SIZE		32
 #define DP_TCL_STATUS_RING_SIZE		32
@@ -220,10 +220,10 @@ struct ath11k_pdev_dp {
 #define DP_RXDMA_BUF_RING_SIZE		4096
 #define DP_RXDMA_REFILL_RING_SIZE	2048
 #define DP_RXDMA_ERR_DST_RING_SIZE	1024
-#define DP_RXDMA_MON_STATUS_RING_SIZE	1024
-#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_BUF_RING_SIZE	4096
-#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_DST_RING_SIZE	2048
-#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_DESC_RING_SIZE	4096
+#define DP_RXDMA_MON_STATUS_RING_SIZE	512
+#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_BUF_RING_SIZE	128
+#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_DST_RING_SIZE	128
+#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_DESC_RING_SIZE	512
 
 #define DP_RX_RELEASE_RING_NUM	3
 
